<section class="content-section"><h2>How to Calculate Square Yards</h2><p>First calculate the area in square feet by multiplying length by width. Then divide by 9 because 1 square yard equals 9 square feet.</p><p><strong>Length in feet × width in feet ÷ 9 = square yards</strong></p></section>
