<section class="content-section"><h2>Square Yards Versus Cubic Yards</h2><p>Square yards measure a flat area and need only length and width. Cubic yards measure volume and need length, width, and depth. For soil, mulch, gravel, or concrete, use the <a href="../">cubic yard calculator</a> instead.</p></section>
